946:Theorem valid_access_store:
947-  forall m1 chunk b ofs v,
948-  valid_access m1 chunk b ofs Writable ->
949-  { m2: mem | store chunk m1 b ofs v = Some m2 }.
950-Proof.
951-  intros.
952-  unfold store.
953-  destruct (valid_access_dec m1 chunk b ofs Writable).
954-  eauto.
955-  contradiction.
956-Defined.
